/**
 * Universal RM ONE onboarding pipeline.
 *
 * Supports two Excel formats:
 *  1. SIMPLIFIED (3-tab): "Your Team" | "Clients & Projects" | "Assignments"
 *     Backend expands each tab into the individual DB tables automatically.
 *  2. DETAILED (10-tab): one tab per DB table (legacy / power-user format).
 *
 * INSERT order always respects FK dependencies.
 * TenantID is auto-stamped — never required in Excel.
 */
